00:10:33.867 --> 00:10:35.697
Maybe that time is 10-midnight.

00:10:35.697 --> 00:10:38.640
But, really there's no magic answer here.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:41.904
The answer is more time and
faster within that time.

00:10:41.904 --> 00:10:44.261
I think the faster part
confuses a lot of people.

00:10:44.261 --> 00:10:47.554
